Here is the root cause:
The bug is caused by the GPIO interrupt status being masked before the MAC IRQ is enabled due to a hardware deficiency. This results in GPIO interrupts not being reported after the initial masking, as the interrupt status is not cleared, leading to a failure in acknowledging and handling GPIO interrupts properly.

